<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Pedido recibido</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Inter", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7fa;
        color: #4a5566;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 640px;
        background-color: #fff;
        margin: 40px auto;
        padding: 40px 50px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        border: 2px solid #555;
      }

      .logo {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #111;
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 36px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 28px;
      }

      .notice {
        background-color: #f5f8ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #0052e2;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        margin: 22px 0 30px;
      }

      .customer-section {
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-top: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .customer-section .header {
        background-color: #f8f8f8;
        padding: 10px 15px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #333;
      }

      .customer-section td {
        padding: 6px 15px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .info-label {
        color: #4a5566;
        font-weight: 600;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .info-value {
        color: #555;
      }

      .table-section {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .table-section th {
        background-color: #f8f8f8;
        padding: 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-align: left;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
        color: #333;
      }

      .table-section td {
        padding: 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        color: #555;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .table-section tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #96a2b3;
        margin-top: 20px;
        background-color: #f1f1f1;
        padding: 30px 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="logo">
        <img
          class="max-width"
          border="0"
          style="display:block; color:#000000; text-decoration:none; font-family:Helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; max-width:100% !important; width:100%; height:auto !important;"
          width="600"
          alt="Cartago4x4"
          data-proportionally-constrained="true"
          data-responsive="true"
          src="http://cdn.mcauto-images-production.sendgrid.net/54b412839bf00c0a/2770dc28-348f-4b7f-b46b-d3df6786e14a/1311x103.jpg"
        />
      </p>

      <h1>Hola {{customer.first_name}},</h1>

      <p>Hemos recibido correctamente tu pedido. A continuación te compartimos
        el resumen de compra y la información del pago.</p>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Método de pago:</strong>
        {{payment_method_label}}<br />
        {{payment_note}}
      </div>

      <table class="customer-section" width="100%">
        <tr>
          <td class="header" colspan="2">Información del pedido</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="info-label" width="40%">Nombre completo:</td>
          <td class="info-value">{{customer.full_name}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="info-label">Email:</td>
          <td class="info-value">{{customer.email}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{#if customer.nif_cif}}
          <tr>
            <td class="info-label">NIF/CIF:</td>
            <td class="info-value">{{customer.nif_cif}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/if}}
        <tr>
          <td class="info-label">Dirección de envío:</td>
          <td class="info-value">{{shipping_address}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{#if billing_address}}
          <tr>
            <td class="info-label">Dirección de facturación:</td>
            <td class="info-value">{{billing_address}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/if}}
        <tr>
          <td class="info-label">Nº Pedido:</td>
          <td class="info-value">{{display_id}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="info-label">Fecha:</td>
          <td class="info-value">{{order_date}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <table class="table-section">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Artículo</th>
            <th style="text-align:center">Cantidad</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">Unidad</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">Subtotal</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each items}}
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div>{{variant}}</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px; color:#85878E;">Ref: {{ref}}</div>
              </td>
              <td style="text-align:center">{{quantity}}</td>
              <td style="text-align:right">{{unit_price_ex_tax}}</td>
              <td style="text-align:right">{{totals.subtotal}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          <tr>
            <td
              colspan="3"
              style="text-align:right; font-weight:600;"
            >Subtotal</td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{subtotal_ex_tax}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{#if discount_total}}
            <tr>
              <td
                colspan="3"
                style="text-align:right; font-weight:600;"
              >Descuento</td>
              <td style="text-align:right">- {{discount_total}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/if}}
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="text-align:right; font-weight:600;">
              <div>Gastos de envío</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px; color:#85878E;">Tipo:
                {{shipping_method}}</div>
            </td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{shipping_total}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="text-align:right; font-weight:600;">Impuestos
              ({{tax_rate}}% IVA)</td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{tax_total}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td
              colspan="3"
              style="text-align:right; font-weight:600;"
            >Total</td>
            <td style="text-align:right">{{total}}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <p
        style="text-align:center; margin-top: 60px; margin-bottom: 20px;"
      >Gracias por confiar en nosotros.</p>
      <p style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;">
        Si tienes cualquier duda sobre tu pedido, escríbenos a
        <a
          href="mailto:contacto@cartago4x4.es"
          style="color:#0052e2;"
        >contacto@cartago4x4.es</a>.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;">
        <a
          href="https://cartago4x4.es/terminos-condiciones"
          style="margin-right:1rem"
        >Términos y Condiciones</a>
        <a href="https://cartago4x4.es/politica-privacidad">Política de
          privacidad</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px;">&copy; 2026
        {{company_name}}. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">Alameda de San Antón n23<br />Apartado de Correos
        5085<br />30205 Cartagena, Murcia</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>